Description: Select controlled items for factorial designs, matched with exact tolerances on any number of variables. Also supports (and can be combined with) matching on Euclidean distances and the outputs of functions. Full documentation is available at <https://jackedtaylor.github.io/LexOPSdocs/>. There is a 'shiny' app built with GUIs which supports most package functionality. The package is described by Taylor et al. (2020) <doi:10.3758/s13428-020-01389-1>.
